	KEYPAD LAYOUT for VTEDIT		OTHER KEYS
_________________________________________
| "BLUE"  |  "RED"  | "GREY"  |   "^"   |	CTRL/C  EXIT FROM MACRO
|  SAVE   |  TECO   | UNSAVE  |  UP IN  |	CTRL/D  KILL REST OF LINE*
|  TEXT*  | COMMAND |  TEXT   | COLUMN* |	CTRL/K	KILL LINE*
|_________|_________|_________|_________|	CTRL/U	KILL START OF LINE
|   "7"   |   "8"   |   "9"   |   "V"   |	CTRL/Z	EXIT FROM MACRO
|  OPEN   |  PAGE*  |  QUOTE  | DOWN IN |	BK SP	GO TO END OF LINE*
|  LINE*  |         |  NEXT*  | COLUMN* |	DELETE	DELETE PREVIOUS*
|_________|_________|_________|_________|	2 ESC'S	REPEAT TECO COMMAND
|   "4"   |   "5"   |   "6"   |   ">"   |
|   UP    | DELETE* |  DELETE |  CURSOR |	ARGUMENTS
|  LINE*  |CHARACTER|   LAST  |  RIGHT* |
|_________|_________|_________|_________|	ALL STARRED (*) COMMANDS
|   "1"   |   "2"   |   "3"   |   "<"   |	OPTIONALLY TAKE AN ARGUMENT
|   TOP   |  BOTTOM |  START  |  CURSOR |	ENTERED AS <ESC><DIGITS>
| OF PAGE | OF PAGE | OF LINE |    LEFT*|
|_________|_________|_________|_________|
|        "0"        |   "."   | "ENTER" |
|      DOWN LINE*   | SEARCH* | SEARCH  |
|                   |         |ARGUMENT*|
|___________________|_________|_________|
